@startuml
actor Learner
participant "LMS" as LMS
participant "MySQL" as DB
participant "MongoDB" as MDB
participant "Celery" as Celery

Learner -> LMS: POST /api/enrollment/v1/
LMS -> DB: INSERT course_enrollment
DB --> LMS: OK
LMS -> MDB: Initialize discussion for learner
MDB --> LMS: OK
LMS -> Celery: send enrollment confirmation email
Celery -> Learner: Email sent
LMS --> Learner: 201 Created
@enduml